      "description": "Delta State University Applicant Portal | Senior Secretary - Mathematics and Sciences Skip to Main Content About Academics admissions Student Life Athletics Alumni & Friends my DSU Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Senior Secretary - Mathematics and Sciences Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Please include the names and contact information of 3-5 references. If you would like to add a letter of recommendation please upload them with your application under optional documents. Posting Details Position Information Job Title Senior Secretary - Mathematics and Sciences Working Title Senior Secretary - Mathematics and Sciences Position Type Staff Department Mathematics and Sciences Posting Number 201201744 Full or Part Time Full Time Benefit Eligible Yes If Other, Please Explain: Tenure/Non-Tenure Track Non-Tenure Track Salary Basis 12 month If Other, Please Explain: Position Summary Information Responsibilities Manage the office of the Division of Mathematics and Sciences and assist the chair. Ensure workflow for the division office is maintained and assist with division operations as needed. Liaise with faculty, staff, and students in the division, assist with budgets, purchasing, events planning as needed, and other duties as required and needed. Assist the planetarium director with running of shows, handling guests and selling items to guests. All other duties as assigned by the chair of the Division. Qualifications This position must have at leas