    "https://deltastate.peopleadmin.com/postings/4607": {
      "title": "Line Services Technician",
      "description": "Delta State University Applicant Portal | Line Services Technician Skip to Main Content About Academics admissions Student Life Athletics Alumni & Friends my DSU Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Line Services Technician Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Apply on the DSU website. Posting Details Position Information Job Title Line Services Technician Working Title Line Service Technician Position Type Staff Department Commercial Aviation Posting Number 201201505 Full or Part Time Part Time Benefit Eligible No If Other, Please Explain: Tenure/Non-Tenure Track Non-Tenure Track Salary Basis Hourly If Other, Please Explain: Position Summary Information Responsibilities Fueling, towing, and detailing aircraft. Maintaining the areas of Flight Operations that DSU custodial services does not cover. Changing of building lights bulbs. Fuel truck preventative maintenance. Assistance of the Aircraft Mechanics whenever possible. Qualifications GED or High School education preferred. Preference given to individual who has a documented mechanic background. Must have reliable transportation. Salary Commensurate with experience, qualifications, and university’s resources. Minimum Qualifications No Federal or alcohol/drug related convictions. Must have reliable transportation. Preferred Qualifications GED or High School education preferred. Preference given to individual who has a documented mechanic background. Special Instructions to Applicants Apply on the DSU website. Additional Information We would like this to be listed as “multiple re-current positions” just as the Flight Instructor positions are listed. Posting Detail Information Open Date 06/10/2024 Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Posting Specific Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * How did you hear about this employment opportunity? DSU Employee DSU Job Website Invited by Department to Apply MS State Employment Service HigherEdJobs Chronicle of Higher Education Diverse Issues Indeed.com Other * Will you now or in the future require \"sponsorship\" for an employment based visa status? Yes No Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Letter of Reference 1 Letter of Reference 2 Delta State University is an Equal Employment Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer. Delta State University is committed to maintaining a learning and working environment free from sexual and gender-based discrimination or harassment. Our goal is for all to have equal access to the many great services and opportunities we offer. For more information, or to report an incident, see https://www.deltastate.edu/titleix/ or email titleix@deltastate.edu . To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
